{
  "atom": "cli/atoms/std-orb-lint-expectation-event-unfired.lolo",
  "trait": "OrbLintExpectationEventUnfired",
  "note": "Expected findings are the code, path, message and suggestion `orb validate` (the Rust validator) reports for the same program. Cases copy tests/expectations_validation.rs a_strict_event_the_trait_declares_but_never_fires_is_unsatisfied, a_strict_event_the_trait_fires_is_satisfied and control_a_lenient_event_the_trait_never_fires_is_not_reported; the rest pin the control-fired, sibling-trait, dynamic event-prop binding, no-emit and absent-trait arms. The fired maps of the steps are what std-orb-fired-events answers; the parity run feeds the real ones.",
  "cases": [
    {
